    "updated_at": "2021-02-19T11:41:25Z",
    "body": "The package module displays the version as defined in package manager  files like `package.json` or `Cargo.toml`. What you're seeing here are the python module and likely the java module (see `starship explain`).\r\n\r\nYou can disable these modules by adding this to your config file.\r\n```toml\r\n[java]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[python]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```",
